    "Summaries": {
        "eng": "Hinako Nakayama is a high school girl, that by the request of her twin brother Hikaro to switch places with him in his school, she enters an all-boys school which is filled with delinquents.",
        "jpn": "中山ひな子は女子高生で、双子の弟ひかろに転校を依頼され、滞納者でいっぱいの男子校に入学。"
    },
    "Aliases": [
        "Kenka Banchō Otome: Girl Beats Boys",
